<!-- The default room's ground, accent and ink, straight out of client/styles/tokens.css `:root` (astrolabe-dark)
     :root. The window wears them so the system bars, the letterbox behind the
     WebView and the moment before the first paint are all the same colour as the
     page — not a white flash with a dark app arriving late. -->
